Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:14.74,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It feels so nice when you \Ncan head to school early.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:18.98,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,We have an English quiz today,\Nso I'll do some review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:22.87,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I should get fresh water for\Nthe flowers Satou-san brought, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:27.81,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yes, an excellent start! \NToday is sure to be a great day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.38,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning, Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:32.57,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's Kanechika-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.76,Flashback,NARUMI,0,0,0,,How cultured!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:36.64,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:39.05,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you about that guy in your—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.05,0:00:40.22,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.57,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm flattered you said I could \Nbe a memorable star actor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:45.83,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,and asked me to join your club,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:48.68,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,but I have a different purpose in life...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:50.32,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,When did I say all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:54.04,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:57.42,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,But I hope you can fulfill \Nyour purpose in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:58.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:03.45,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Still, without you in our club, \Nour future is bleak indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.45,0:01:06.78,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I-I'd be happy to help in any way I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:08.93,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Really? That'd be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:11.96,DefaultItalics,NARUMI,0,0,0,,This girl's a pushover. I worry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:45.64,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Let's get right to watching this video, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.52,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,An old TV show?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.44,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:55.21,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,It went up against a super-hit show in the \Nsame time slot and lost the ratings battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:58.40,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,but it was a simple, good show, \Nand it still has plenty of hardcore fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.91,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh... But what does it have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:00.91,DefaultItalicsTop,TV,0,0,0,,Can I come hang out tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:04.16,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sh... Shima-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.04,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wow! He was so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:06.02,DefaultTop,NARUMI,0,0,0,,You noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:07.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Look at his big, round eyes! \NHe's like an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:09.03,DefaultTop,NARUMI,0,0,0,,He played Kanade-kun, \Nthe lead's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.65,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wait, what is Shima-kun doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.03,0:03:12.83,DefaultTop,NARUMI,0,0,0,,He appears in most episodes and \Nis really... Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:13.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He's so tiny! And cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:15.26,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,What do you think of his acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:19.20,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm no expert,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:21.61,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,but I think it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:23.43,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, he is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:24.65,DefaultItalicsTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Why are you always like this, Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:27.46,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,It's remarkable enough that he could express\Nsuch a range of emotions at that age,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:29.87,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,but he also did it while understanding \Nthe context of the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:30.94,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Really smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.94,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Iwakura-san... No, Mitsumi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:37.86,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Could you convince Shima-kun \Nto join the drama club?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:38.82,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.44,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I don't know about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:42.59,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,You two are close, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:45.57,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Please help me! I can't \Nget through to him at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:49.08,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Actually, even if he refuses, \NI just want to know why!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:53.74,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,You're his {\i1}friend{\i0}! Could you ask him for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:03:59.75,Default,MINE,0,0,0,,Morning, Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:02.06,Default,MINE,0,0,0,,You're here later than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:03.08,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:05.33,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,My perfect morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.47,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Morning, Mitsumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:09.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shima-kun, Mukai-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:11.45,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Just now, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.64,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I saw Terada-sensei doing \Nsquats in the courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:19.26,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,We should learn from his example!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:22.19,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.70,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.83,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He was on TV, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:30.29,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If I were him, I would've \Nbragged about it in my self-intro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:33.31,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But since he didn't mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:36.31,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,maybe he doesn't want anyone to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.08,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Given that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:39.45,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I saw your little show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:42.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So, why aren't you joining \Nthe drama club, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:45.84,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I can't bring it up! \NIt'd be tactless as all hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:50.35,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Time's up! Pass your papers forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:58.61,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone get \Nso depressed over a quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:04:59.69,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.14,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:04.32,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Our next class is this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.32,0:05:06.11,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I don't know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:07.32,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:09.74,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:12.42,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,It looks like Iwakura-san's \Nnot feeling too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.00,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.25,Default,PE TEACH,0,0,0,,Take the rest of the class off \Nand go rest in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:18.58,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Eggscuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:21.66,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,The nurse isn't in, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:26.54,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:29.59,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm so distracted by this one thing, \NI'm messing up everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.63,0:05:31.26,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:31.97,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:35.04,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.63,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:38.37,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,The boys are playing soccer over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:40.90,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I came here to drink some water, \Nand then I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.99,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,So, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.90,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I got hit in the face by a volleyball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:46.40,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:49.80,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, the nosebleed stopped immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:50.76,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, is this my chance to ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:52.58,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Let's try slipping it in casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:55.51,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Did you watch that TV show yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:58.11,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Nope. Was there something good on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:06:00.61,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Heh. I didn't watch it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.71,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You've been acting weird today. \NIs something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:12.22,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sorry, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.97,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:17.07,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Senpai's up to his tricks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:19.98,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't be too mad at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:22.71,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I did think he was being a little pushy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:26.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,but it felt like Kanechika-senpai's just \Ntrying to do whatever he can for his club.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.34,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Well, it's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.50,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,It was gonna get out eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:37.17,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,And people who went to my middle school, \Nlike Mukai, already know anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.37,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:42.53,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,With all due respect to Senpai, \NI don't wanna act anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:46.92,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I did give it my all back then, \Nnot because I found it fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.16,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,but because it made my mom happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.50,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:59.17,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What made you come to Tokyo \Nto try to join the government?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:02.69,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,That thing you said was a joke, right? \NAbout being born to lead or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Forget about that already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:10.95,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Well, my hometown's a great place. \NBeautiful landscape and ocean views.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.84,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But it's pretty badly underpopulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:17.57,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I could have stayed there and helped,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:21.40,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,but Japan's full of places like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:26.84,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If I can, I want to tackle \Nthe problem at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:30.59,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm like my \Nhometown's biggest prodigy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:34.30,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You don't need to laugh it off. \NI think that's a great goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:39.86,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:40.73,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:44.76,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You and Kanechika-senpai are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:48.27,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm really just doing it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:54.66,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,But putting your goal out there means \Ndealing with hopes and expectations, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:59.56,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I couldn't handle it, \Npathetic as it may sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:04.42,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:08.41,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I nearly let the pressure get to me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:09.22,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:10.30,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:14.93,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I was so afraid of failing my entrance \Nexams, I couldn't even eat for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:17.63,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I would've lost my mind \Nif it weren't for Fumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:18.47,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Fumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:21.68,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, she's my best friend. \NWe grew up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:24.19,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:27.75,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Let's go grab some gyoza, Mitsumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:28.82,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.37,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What if I forget this vocab while eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:34.71,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:36.57,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Pops is waiting outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:37.95,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Just get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.16,Flashback,WAITRESS,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:42.68,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Wow, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.56,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Lemme divvy up the fried rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.85,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Once you're done with your exams,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:53.52,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,let's come back here for gyoza. Pass or fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:55.54,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There's nothing worth celebrating if I fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:58.35,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Hah! In society's eyes, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:02.73,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,But having taken up the challenge \Nwill be worth a whole lot to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:05.48,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,and to me, too, because \NI know how hard you're trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.34,0:09:43.43,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,S'good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:44.91,Flashback,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.86,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Even if I'm only doing this for myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:54.40,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,it made me happy to have a friend \Nknow and watch over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.16,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sounds like a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:56.91,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:59.11,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:01.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,We can do the same, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:05.20,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If you ever find a goal for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:09.21,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,then, succeed or fail, we'll go anywhere \Nyou want and eat some good food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.96,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,That's a promise, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.43,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.84,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He's not going to join. Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:22.22,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:23.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.98,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,But why? He told you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:28.90,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yes, but I can't tell you. \NA good friend wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:34.02,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Let him know he's always welcome \Nif he ever changes his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:37.80,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:41.53,Flashback,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,That's a promise, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:47.95,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So why does my pinky feel all tingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:56.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Long time no see, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:58.04,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Morning, Mitsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.17,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Been a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.26,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:03.10,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You look like you made the most \Nout of the Golden Week holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.43,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:08.21,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,My aunt showed me all over Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:11.05,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, right. You're still new here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:13.33,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,And she helped you pick out \Nsome new clothes, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:14.73,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:16.55,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What'd you guys do over the break?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:19.70,Default,TSUKASA,0,0,0,,I was too busy studying for midterms, \Nso I didn't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:20.61,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:21.86,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:24.38,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You're cramming for exams already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:25.83,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Nope! Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:27.58,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,You and your living-abroad experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:29.43,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Must be nice not having to study English.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:31.83,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You're not getting any help from me \Nif you're gonna be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.64,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You've lived abroad, Yuzu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.20,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Whoa, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:38.71,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,It was only until third grade. \NI still have to grind vocab like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.54,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,This school sure has a lot of \Nstudents who've lived abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:42.47,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.85,Default,TSUKASA,0,0,0,,I hear there are a couple \Nor so in each class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:50.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I thought I was disciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:54.11,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But I've lost control of myself \Never since getting into high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:56.23,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Now I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.48,DefaultItalics,SAKURA,0,0,0,,She's so damn square.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.87,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,I think you have the right mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.87,0:12:02.24,DefaultItalics,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.97,DefaultItalics,SAKURA,0,0,0,,She scored the highest in the entrance \Nexams without going to cram school,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:07.14,DefaultItalics,SAKURA,0,0,0,,and she was in the top 20 \Nin the recent tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.67,DefaultItalics,SAKURA,0,0,0,,What in the world is she worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:12.94,DefaultItalics,SAKURA,0,0,0,,That said, it's good that \Nshe's staying on her toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:13.75,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:16.63,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,You've joined the Tsubame Society?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:17.84,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:20.01,Default,SAKURA,0,0,0,,Then you know someone who's \Nthe definition of disciplined!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:22.17,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.71,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,I can't accept these budget cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:27.02,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,You know we're taking this seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:30.15,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Many clubs take their activities seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:33.73,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Which is why we took another look at \Nthe budget, taking results into account,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:37.69,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,and concluded that the cultural \Nclubs were underfunded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:40.23,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Segawa-san, as the soccer \Nteam's future captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:42.37,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,you should try to spend \Nyour budget more wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.78,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,We can barely make do \Nwith the {\i1}current{\i0} budget!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:48.36,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,Also, we're starting to do \Nbetter in tournaments!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:51.64,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,We found no concrete evidence of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:54.79,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,As I said, if you write a report \Nsupporting your case, we'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:56.94,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:12:59.88,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:07.91,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,We met in the student council \Noffice the other day. Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:12.02,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm Iwakura—No, please call me \NMitsumi, Takamine-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:16.74,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I've been trying to get rid \Nof the slacker within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.74,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,When I went to Hanazono-sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:23.09,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,she said nobody in this school \Nis as disciplined as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:27.91,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, would you let me \Nhelp with your student council work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.03,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Sensei said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:32.52,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:35.62,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I-If you insist, far be it from me to refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.42,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:46.17,DefaultItalics,MALETEACHER,0,0,0,,Hanazono-sensei's gotta be \Nthe biggest slacker in the faculty here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:00.78,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I want to take the express that leaves \Nat six past the hour and transfer to a bus,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:01.98,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,which means I should leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:04.37,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Council Member Okada-san's sick today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.37,0:14:06.98,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,so I'll stop by Noyama-san's place instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:11.16,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,It's just to say hi and drop off this \Npaperwork, so join me, Mitsumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:11.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:15.50,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,A lecture on urban farming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:18.41,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I had no idea students did \Nplanning for things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:20.55,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,It isn't that surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:24.20,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Some schools even have their students \Nplan their own school trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:25.30,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:28.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,When do they study?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:31.26,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,The reality is, some people are naturally \Ngifted, and some just work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:35.46,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Personally, I recognized that \NI can't keep up unless I work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:37.52,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,That's why I started keeping this schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.27,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:42.49,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Objective self-analysis \Nand tireless hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:44.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:45.78,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,A-Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.50,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I can't tell her that my disposition
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:53.44,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,leads to weekly nightmares about \Nmissing a bus or train and crying, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:54.03,DefaultItalicsTop,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:58.87,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I'm happy I found someone \Nwho truly understands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:02.60,DefaultItalicsTop,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,As her senpai, I must put her \Non the right path!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:03.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Do you want a gummy? \NI bought some this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.87,0:15:05.54,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,It's times like these, Mitsumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:06.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:11.69,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,From watching you today, I've noticed \Nthat you have the tendency to space out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:12.93,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I-I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.85,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Do you have any study material on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:15.69,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.43,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Don't waste your travel time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:21.02,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Make the most of each moment, \Nso you don't have any regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:21.94,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.23,DefaultItalics,BOTH,0,0,0,,No regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:28.39,Default,NOYAMA,0,0,0,,See you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:30.57,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Yes. We'll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.57,0:15:33.27,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,That took longer than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.27,0:15:35.20,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The bus leaves in two minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:36.53,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:39.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Do you think Noyama-san's farm is that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:43.38,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,We can find out some other time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.11,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,If we run, we might still make the bus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.29,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:48.85,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I nearly forgot! Discipline!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.10,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,The next bus isn't for another fifteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:56.88,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Ugh, my stomach hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:59.46,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I was supposed to have finished \Nshopping for study guides in Shibuya—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:00.35,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:04.89,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Wha? Where did you get that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.89,0:16:06.61,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He was just over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:09.74,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,This must be a house cat, right? \NHe's really friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:11.62,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.09,0:16:13.45,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,It's like... Mitsumi-san seems diligent,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:15.11,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,but deep down, she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:19.37,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's amazing that buses show up \Nevery fifteen minutes here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.37,0:16:21.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That'll go by in a flash \Nplaying with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:30.29,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like panicking \Nwill make the bus come any faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:32.88,Default,PETOWNER,0,0,0,,Taro-chan! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:37.55,Default,PETOWNER,0,0,0,,Thank you! I guess he \Njust slipped out the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:39.06,Default,PETOWNER,0,0,0,,Have these, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:40.51,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.56,Default,PETOWNER,0,0,0,,There's lots of traffic here, \Nso I'm glad you found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.65,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I lost 63 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:53.91,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Can I get back on track by at least \Nstudying geography on this bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:55.91,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Rainfall in Southeast Asia,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:57.59,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,and then memorize...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:59.58,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wow! Look, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.41,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:11.80,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I didn't know even Tokyo \Nhad this kind of scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:27.40,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sorry, I did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:28.89,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll memorize some vocab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:38.09,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:40.01,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Days like this aren't too bad in moderation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:46.87,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Takamine-senpai is so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:49.00,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,She's like some hotshot CEO!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:52.42,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,"Make the most of each moment, \Nso you don't have any regrets!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:55.38,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Maybe I should make a schedule, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:58.98,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,First, I need to take a closer look \Nat my usual time-wasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:01.48,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Decide what food to get at the \Nconvenience store in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:04.42,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll need that decision-making \Nability for government work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:08.05,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I should use recess to study, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:11.97,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Asking friends and teachers for help \Nwill build my communication skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.97,0:18:15.90,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Should I turn down one in three \Ninvitations to hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.78,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hmm, I guess it depends on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:21.57,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,My calls home run pretty long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:25.79,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But they worry about me. \NI can't call that wasted time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:29.43,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That time I spent with \NFumi was indispensable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.43,0:18:32.29,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But can I only say that because \Nit worked out in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:35.79,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What does having no regrets even mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:43.68,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:46.95,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.73,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning, Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:36.83,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:38.79,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's with those bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.49,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, they're that bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:44.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I was up late coming up with a schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:45.62,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,A schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:50.09,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I thought I'd give what I learned \Nfrom Takamine-senpai a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:53.12,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wow. {\i1}Wow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:55.47,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Not great if you're losing sleep, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.81,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm just not used to it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:01.13,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Takamine-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.51,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.39,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:07.45,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.93,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Forgive me. Good morning, \NMitsumi-san, Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:12.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thank you for yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:13.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I learned a lot from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:15.94,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Right. About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:18.99,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a good idea \Nto follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:22.34,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I was too ashamed to mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:25.03,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,but I failed to get into my \Npreferred middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:29.28,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I do think about the what-ifs,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:32.41,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,but I've come to enjoy my high school life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:39.30,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,You never find out where you made the best \Nuse of your time until much later in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:44.22,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,So ultimately, I think what matters \Nis to decide how you spend it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.55,0:20:47.05,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,Takamine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:49.48,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,I brought your stupid paperwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:51.95,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,The soccer team's achievements \Nover the past few years!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:54.54,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,Member count! \NAll the data you could ever want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.40,DefaultTop,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,Well? You can't complain now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:57.09,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I certainly cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.09,0:20:59.42,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I'll go through this today \Nand take it into account.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.69,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I get back to you \Ntomorrow or the day after?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:04.57,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:06.20,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Hmm? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:09.55,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,This data is very well organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.55,0:21:11.33,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Did you do this yourself, Segawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.87,0:21:15.33,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:16.12,Default,SEGAWABUD,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:18.92,Default,SEGAWA,0,0,0,,Don't just start smiling \Nat me out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:20.08,Default,SEGAWABUD,0,0,0,,Segawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.50,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Where does he find all that energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.56,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll see you in the student \Ncouncil office sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:32.47,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Takamine-senpai really is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.39,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:37.32,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,But, hey, you heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:40.23,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You should do things your own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:45.07,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But I want to stick to this \Nafter all the time I spent on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:48.55,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yeah, but sticking to a method that \Nyou know isn't gonna work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.58,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,That's the definition of a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.81,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:56.06,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Your logic is so cold, Shima-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:57.51,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Huh? Yikes, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.51,0:21:59.21,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to be a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:02.15,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,C-Cold, but true...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.99,0:22:03.28,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Listen, you've got things going for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:08.06,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You've got your own pace, \Nyour own style of doing things.

